ind":"update","title":"Random Encounter Rework and Key Binds (Update v0.64)","summary":"Getting ready for Steam Next fest with a major update to random encounters. Now there are more reasons to engage with random encounters with a variety of new locations, and encounter types.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T16:57:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695896","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1840310314348360","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.53.03","summary":"Version: v0.53.03- Fixed an issue where animals made noise while dead.- Fixed an issue where the player coould not complete the \"Prove your worth\" quest.- Fixed an issue where the teleport overlay could become stuck and no longer disapear.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T22:37:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348360","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1840310314348158","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.53.02","summary":"Version: 0.53.02- Fixed an issue where mouse sensitivity was not being saved between levels.- Added FOV slider option to the settings.- Added button to reset settings to default.- Added audio to the grapnel hook.- Remapped flashlight key to Shift-C.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T20:11:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348158","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1839676055896489","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.53.01","summary":"- Fixed an issue where players would fall through the world when moving between passages.- Replaced dog hostile sound to make less repetitive. NOTE: If you had issue #1. You might need to select \"Revivify\" from the pause menu when you run into this problem. After that, it should be fixed for you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T04:28:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055896489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1839676055892001","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.53","summary":"Version: 0.53- Fixed an issue where the elevator could not be called back down.- Lowered attack speed of Maggots.- Fixed issues where player could lose UI functionality during Dialogue and while the Quest Log was open.- Fixed an issue where bullet holes and spray paint did not work in the Dead Town Office Sub-Location.- Fixed an issue with elevator occlusion.- Fixed an issue where the ammo counter overlapped with world geometry.- Fixed an issue where a vent was too small in the Data Zenter.- Fix","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T04:47:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892001","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1833968530892839","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.52.05","summary":"Version: 0.52.05- Fixed issue where vents could not be accessed in Data Zenter.- Adjusted nav mesh of Data Zenter to prevent NPCs from getting stuck on walls.- Updated texture of the main map to be more desert like.- Added city sprites to the main map.- Adjusted pathing to make it harder for NPCs to become stuck on corners in general.- Fixed an issue where settings were not saved between the main menu and the game.- Fixed several typos and grammer issues in dialogue.- Fixed an issue where the pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T04:33:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530892839","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1830797770241247","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.52.03","summary":"Version: 0.52.03 Change List- Uncategorized small bug fixes. - When the player continues the game from the main menu, they will be placed in either the map or the last level they were in before quitting.- Fixed an issue where the starting Augment was the Grapnel Hook by default.- Added additional pathway in Data Zenter.- Fixed an issue where starting a new game did not reset all prior quest progress.- Added an additional Husk Nut to find.- Added the ability to unequip augments.- Replaced Yukon-3","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-27T03:28:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770241247","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1830797770236422","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.52.02","summary":"Change List:- Several bug fixes.- Fixed an issue where buying the grenade augment did not unlock it in the store.- Lowered fire rate of TSCBF Soldier.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T14:57:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770236422","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1830163047263543","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.52.1","summary":"If you have a moment. Please take a sec to fill out this form! Looking to hear your feedback. Thanks! v0.52.1 Change list- Removed random w from controls list.- Added steps to make getting out of sewer water easier.- Fixed crouch invincibility bug.- Adjusted Yukon-38 Paths to add more variety.- Lowered gib heal amount from 15 to 5- Removed Tek-8 from random crate drop list.- Removed Ring of Wealth Procurement from random crate drop list.- Added a few new decorative signs to Dead Town.- Increased","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-19T04:23:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047263543","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645540-1830163047256530","game_id":"steam-3645540","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.52","summary":"Please take a moment to add your feedback via this form! https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc-d3wreRddtu_p-GQ3cvZH-_OWI0MkwTeHrUssRuVbfpf2VA/viewform Change ListAdded a note to Hell's Port related quests that states \"LOCATION NOT AVAILABLE IN DEMO\" to make end of demo more clear.Added loot to Desert Random Encounters.Added more random encounter maps.Added an additional pathway in Yukon-38.Added an additional pathway in the Dead Town Sewers.Added panel that appears when picking up augments","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T04:59:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047256530","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3645540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40: